```mdl
verdict Worker: run, Options and DEFAULT_DISPLACE_GRACE_TIMEOUT match; RuntimeHandle has a different shape.
  status: diverged
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/sdk/worker-framework/src/Worker.ts#run, github:dxos/dxos/packages/sdk/worker-framework/src/Worker.ts#Options, github:dxos/dxos/packages/sdk/worker-framework/src/Worker.ts#DEFAULT_DISPLACE_GRACE_TIMEOUT, github:dxos/dxos/packages/sdk/worker-framework/src/Worker.ts#RuntimeHandle]
